{
  "accountSummary": "Probook is an information technology and services company building an AI operating system for home-services contractors, including plumbing, HVAC, and electrical businesses. Its system is built around dispatch and unifies intake, data cleaning, chat, outbound, and dispatch. Probook is at the Series A stage with 52 employees, 14 open positions listed, and $40M in reported total funding. It is on this list because it was discovered for the Series A vertical-AI project and its research status is needs_review.",
